      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION*** via offr.io platform AUCTION DATE: WEDNESDAY 14TH OCTOBER AT 11AM REGISTRATION FOR THE AUCTION CLOSES ON TUESDAY 13TH OCTOBER AT 4PM\nThe residential site is contained in folio LK1230F and comprises 0.51 acre / 0.21 HA. Planning was previously granted in 2005 for a single storey dwelling house (Planning reference number 05/1823).\nLocated in a peaceful rural area, just a 5 minute drive to the village of Ballyhahill and all local amenities inc. school, preschool, shop, community centre and church, while the county town of Newcastle West is within a 20 minute drive away.\nFull details and particulars from sole selling agent."
